cart apis 
we need cart api to interact with the cart
template language is not ables to handle cartt itself
That is why cart api is here 
1. Method 
2. Element (form element)


{% for item in cart.items %}
    <div class="cart-line-item">
      <a href="{{item.url}}">
        {{ item.image | image_url: width: width 100 | image_tag }}
      </a>
      <h6>{{item.product.title}}</h6>
 <p>{{item.product.price |  money_with_currency}}</p>
 {% for property in items.properties %}
  <p>{{property.first}}: {{property.last}}</p>
 {% endfor %}
      </div>
  {% endfor %}